### ⚙️ CubeMX / HAL Notes

| Peripheral | Role                            | Config summary                                           |
| ---------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| **TIM1**   | PWM output → H-Bridge           | Channel 1 (20 kHz ideal), complementary outputs optional |
| **TIM2**   | Control-loop timer              | 1 kHz update interrupt                                   |
| **ADC1**   | Current sense input             | Single channel, triggered by TIM1 or polled              |
| **USART2** | Telemetry / DE5 command         | 115200 baud, 8N1                                         |
| **GPIO**   | Enable/H-Bridge direction lines | Optional digital outputs                                 |

